      "standard_id": "MeSH",
      "name": "Medical Subject Headings (MeSH)",
      "description": "A controlled, hierarchically organized thesaurus/subject vocabulary for biomedical and health-related information. It provides descriptors, qualifiers (subheadings), supplemental concept records (SCRs), tree structures, scope notes, and data files (XML, RDF, ASCII) used for indexing, cataloging, and searching in MEDLINE/PubMed, the NLM Catalog, and other NLM resources; includes guidance for use, annual updates, and programmatic access (downloads, API, SPARQL)."
